    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji odakl\u0131 cihazlar i\u00e7in h\u0131zl\u0131 tasarruf ak\u0131\u015flar\u0131.": "Fluxos de estalvi r\u00e0pid per a endolls intel\u00b7ligents i dispositius centrats en l'energia.", // EN: Quick saving flows for smart plugs and energy-focused devices.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizler ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 tek merkezde topla. Hemen uygulanabilen tasarruf profilleri ve zamanl\u0131 eko aksiyonlar\u0131 olu\u015ftur.": "Reuneix els endolls intel\u00b7ligents i els dispositius que consumeixen energia en un sol lloc. Crea perfils d'estalvi instantanis i accions ecol\u00f2giques programades.", // EN: Bring smart plugs and energy-consuming devices together in one place. Create instant saving profiles and scheduled eco actions.
    "Ak\u0131ll\u0131 prizleri ve enerji t\u00fcketen cihazlar\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir enerji tasarruf paneli olu\u015ftur. H\u0131zl\u0131 kapatma, eko profiller, zamanlanm\u0131\u015f tasarruf ve t\u00fcketim \u00f6zetleri ekle.": "Crea un panell d'estalvi d'energia que gestioni endolls intel\u00b7ligents i dispositius que consumeixen energia. Afegeix apagada r\u00e0pida, perfils ecol\u00f2gics, estalvi programat i resums d'\u00fas.\\nRellotge despertador intel\u00b7ligent", // EN: Create an energy saving panel that manages smart plugs and energy-consuming devices. Add quick shut-off, eco profiles, scheduled saving and usage summaries.
