    "Bilgilerini girdikten sonra g\u00f6nderilecek ad\u0131mlar\u0131 takip ederek \u015fifreni kolayca yenileyebilirsin.": "Despr\u00e9s d'introduir les teves dades, pots restablir f\u00e0cilment la teva contrasenya seguint els passos que t'enviem.", // EN: After entering your details, you can easily reset your password by following the steps we send.
    "Bilgisayar\u0131nda NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131n\u0131 kullan; ayn\u0131 asistan ve kontroller orada da \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Utilitza l'aplicaci\u00f3 d'escriptori NEXUS al teu ordinador; el mateix assistent i controls tamb\u00e9 funcionen all\u00e0.", // EN: Use the NEXUS desktop app on your computer; the same assistant and controls work there too.
