    "Bir cihaz a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya kapand\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Quan un dispositiu s'enc\u00e9n o s'apaga", // EN: When a device turns on or off
    "Bir cihaza dokununca panelin kontrol ekran\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r; ekranda yaln\u0131zca o cihaz\u0131n destekledi\u011fi \u00f6zellikler g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr. Shelly, WLED ve ESPHome cihazlar\u0131nda a\u00e7/kapat ve parlakl\u0131k do\u011frudan cihaza gider.": "Toqueu un dispositiu per obrir la pantalla de control del panell; nom\u00e9s mostra les funcions que el dispositiu admet. Per als dispositius Shelly, WLED i ESPHome, engegar/apagar i la brillantor van directament al dispositiu.", // EN: Tap a device to open the panel's control screen; it shows only the features that device supports. For Shelly, WLED and ESPHome devices, on/off and brightness go straight to the device.
    "Bir eve kat\u0131l ekran\u0131nda bu kod kullan\u0131l\u0131r.": "Aquest codi s'utilitza a la pantalla Unir-se a una llar.", // EN: This code is used on the Join a Home screen.
