    "Bu 8 haneli kod Apple HomeKit e\u015fle\u015ftirmesi i\u00e7indir ve yaln\u0131zca Apple Ev uygulamas\u0131yla kullan\u0131l\u0131r. Cihaz Shelly, WLED, Tasmota gibi yerel API destekliyorsa yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Aquest codi de 8 d\u00edgits \u00e9s per a l'aparellament amb Apple HomeKit i nom\u00e9s funciona amb l'aplicaci\u00f3 Apple Home. Si el dispositiu admet una API local com Shelly, WLED o Tasmota, el podeu afegir des de la vostra xarxa local.", // EN: This 8-digit code is for Apple HomeKit pairing and only works with the Apple Home app. If the device supports a local API such as Shelly, WLED or Tasmota, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu Cihaz": "Aquest dispositiu", // EN: This Device
    "Bu QR kodu bir Wi-Fi a\u011f\u0131na aittir, cihaz de\u011fildir. Cihaz\u0131 ayn\u0131 a\u011fa ba\u011flad\u0131ktan sonra yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Aquest codi QR pertany a una xarxa Wi-Fi, no a un dispositiu. Despr\u00e9s de connectar el dispositiu a la mateixa xarxa, el pots afegir des de la teva xarxa local.", // EN: This QR code belongs to a Wi-Fi network, not a device. After connecting the device to the same network, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu adreste bilinen bir NEXUS cihaz\u0131 bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n ayn\u0131 a\u011fda ve a\u00e7\u0131k oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "No s'ha trobat cap dispositiu NEXUS conegut en aquesta adre\u00e7a. Assegura't que el dispositiu est\u00e0 ences i connectat a la mateixa xarxa.", // EN: No known NEXUS device was found at this address. Make sure the device is on and on the same network.
    "Bu ak\u0131ll\u0131 uygulamay\u0131 olu\u015ftur:": "Crea aquesta aplicaci\u00f3 intel\u00b7ligent:", // EN: Create this smart app:
    "Bu ak\u0131\u015f i\u00e7in \u00f6nerilen \u00f6zellikler haz\u0131rlan\u0131yor.": "Preparant les funcions suggerides per aquest flux.", // EN: Preparing suggested features for this flow.
    "Bu ayki tasarruf": "Desat aquest mes", // EN: Saved this month
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131.": "No s'ha trobat cap dispositiu compatible en aquesta xarxa.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network.
    "Bu a\u011fda desteklenen bir cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da oldu\u011fundan emin ol; olmazsa a\u015fa\u011f\u0131dan katalo\u011fu ya da QR / kurulum kodunu kullan.": "No s'ha trobat cap dispositiu compatible en aquesta xarxa. Assegura't que el dispositiu est\u00e0 ences i connectat al mateix Wi-Fi; en cas contrari, utilitza el cat\u00e0leg seg\u00fcent o un codi QR / codi de configuraci\u00f3.", // EN: No supported device was found on this network. Make sure the device is on and connected to the same Wi-Fi; otherwise use the catalog below or a QR / setup code.
    "Bu cihaz i\u00e7in yerel koruma": "Protecci\u00f3 local per a aquest dispositiu", // EN: Local protection for this device
    "Bu cihaz s\u00fcr\u00fcm bilgisi payla\u015fm\u0131yor": "Aquest dispositiu no comparteix informaci\u00f3 de la versi\u00f3", // EN: This device doesn't share version info
    "Bu cihaz veya ba\u011flant\u0131 fener deste\u011fi sunmuyor.": "Aquest dispositiu o connexi\u00f3 no admet la llanterna.", // EN: This device or connection doesn't support the flashlight.
    "Bu cihazda otomatik konum deste\u011fi yok.": "Aquest dispositiu no admet la ubicaci\u00f3 autom\u00e0tica.", // EN: This device doesn't support automatic location.
    "Bu davet kodu bulunamad\u0131.": "No s'ha trobat aquest codi d'invitaci\u00f3.", // EN: This invite code wasn't found.
    "Bu ekran, ekledi\u011fin ayd\u0131nlatma cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 odalara g\u00f6re toplar; sahne kaydetti\u011finde \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve tonu birlikte ayarlan\u0131r.": "Aquesta pantalla agrupa els dispositius d'il\u00b7luminaci\u00f3 que has afegit per habitaci\u00f3; quan guardes una escena, el lluminositat i el to s'ajusten junts.", // EN: This screen groups the lighting devices you've added by room; when you save a scene, brightness and tone are set together.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir.": "Els dispositius que afegeixis a aquesta llar es llisten aqu\u00ed.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here.
    "Bu eve ekledi\u011fin cihazlar burada listelenir ve favori kartlar\u0131na ba\u011flan\u0131r.": "Els dispositius que afegeixis a aquesta llar es llisten aqu\u00ed i s'enllacen amb les teves targetes favorites.", // EN: Devices you add to this home are listed here and linked to your favorite cards.
    "Bu evi ve t\u00fcm ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silmek istedi\u011fine emin misin?": "Segur que vols eliminar permanentment aquesta llar i tots els seus ajustos?", // EN: Are you sure you want to permanently delete this home and all its settings?
    "Bu kod desteklenen bir cihaz kodu de\u011fil. Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini biliyorsan yerel a\u011fdan ekleyebilirsin.": "Aquest codi no \u00e9s un codi de dispositiu compatible. Si coneixes l'adre\u00e7a IP del dispositiu, pots afegir-lo des de la teva xarxa local.", // EN: This code isn't a supported device code. If you know the device's IP address, you can add it from your local network.
    "Bu markalar yerel a\u011fdan kontrol edilir": "Aquestes marques es controlen a trav\u00e9s de la teva xarxa local.", // EN: These brands are controlled over your local network
    "Bu mini uygulama resm\u00ee sa\u011flay\u0131c\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan sunulur.": "Aquesta mini aplicaci\u00f3 \u00e9s proporcionada pel prove\u00efdor oficial.", // EN: This mini app is provided by the official provider.
    "Bu ortam kamera eri\u015fimini desteklemiyor.": "Aquest entorn no admet acc\u00e9s a la c\u00e0mera.", // EN: This environment doesn't support camera access.
    "Bu ortamda a\u011f taramas\u0131 kullan\u0131lam\u0131yor.": "L'exploraci\u00f3 de la xarxa no est\u00e0 disponible aqu\u00ed.", // EN: Network scanning isn't available here.
    "Bu ortamda g\u00fcvenli \u015fifreleme yok": "No hi ha xifratge segur en aquest entorn.", // EN: No secure encryption in this environment
    "Bu senaryo aktifle\u015fti\u011finde ilgili cihazlar otomatik olarak ayarlan\u0131r.": "Quan s'executi aquest escenari, els dispositius relacionats s'ajustaran autom\u00e0ticament.", // EN: When this scenario runs, the related devices are adjusted automatically.
    "Bu senaryodan etkilenen cihaz yok \u2014 \u00f6nce uygun cihaz ekle.": "Cap dispositiu es veu afectat per aquest escenari \u2014 afegeix primer un dispositiu adequat.", // EN: No devices are affected by this scenario — add a suitable device first.
    "Bu senaryoyu kullanmak i\u00e7in uyumlu cihaz eklemelisin.": "Necessites afegir un dispositiu compatible per utilitzar aquest escenari.", // EN: You need to add a compatible device to use this scenario.
    "Bu tek evin. Silersen bo\u015f bir \"Evim\" yeniden olu\u015fturulur. Devam edilsin mi?": "Aquesta \u00e9s la teva \u00fanica llar. Si la suprimeixes, es crear\u00e0 de nou una \"La meva llar\" buida. Continuar?", // EN: This is your only home. If you delete it, an empty "My Home" will be created again. Continue?
