    "Cihaz\u0131m neden \u00e7evrimd\u0131\u015f\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcyor?": "Per qu\u00e8 el meu dispositiu apareix fora de l\u00ednia?", // EN: Why does my device show as offline?
    "Cihaz\u0131n IP adresini yaz, NEXUS konu\u015fabildi\u011fi protokol\u00fc kendisi anlas\u0131n.": "Escriviu l'adre\u00e7a IP del dispositiu i NEXUS detectar\u00e0 quin protocol utilitza.", // EN: Type the device's IP address and NEXUS figures out which protocol it speaks.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modemini kontrol et. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekle. Ad\u0131mlar: Cihazlar > cihaz\u0131 se\u00e7 > Kald\u0131r.": "Comproveu la connexi\u00f3 Wi-Fi del dispositiu i del vostre router. Si el problema continua, elimineu el dispositiu i afegiu-lo de nou. Passos: Dispositius > trieu el dispositiu > Elimina.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device and add it again. Steps: Devices > choose the device > Remove.
    "Cihaz\u0131n Wi-Fi ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 ve modeminizi kontrol edin. Sorun s\u00fcrerse cihaz\u0131 NEXUS uygulamas\u0131ndan kald\u0131r\u0131p yeniden ekleyin.": "Comproveu la connexi\u00f3 Wi-Fi del dispositiu i del vostre router. Si el problema continua, elimineu el dispositiu de l'aplicaci\u00f3 NEXUS i afegiu-lo de nou.", // EN: Check the device's Wi-Fi connection and your router. If the problem continues, remove the device from the NEXUS app and add it again.
    "Cihaz\u0131n g\u00f6r\u00fcnm\u00fcyorsa QR tarama veya kurulum kodu yolunu kullan. Destek ve y\u00f6nlendirme i\u00e7in yard\u0131m sayfas\u0131n\u0131 a\u00e7abilirsin.": "Si el vostre dispositiu no apareix, utilitzeu l'escaneig QR o un codi de configuraci\u00f3. Podeu obrir la p\u00e0gina d'ajuda per obtenir suport i orientaci\u00f3.", // EN: If your device doesn't show up, use QR scanning or a setup code. You can open the help page for support and guidance.
    "Cihaz\u0131n konum (GPS) servisi kapal\u0131. A\u00e7\u0131p tekrar dene.": "El servei de localitzaci\u00f3 (GPS) del vostre dispositiu est\u00e0 desactivat. Activa'l i torna-ho a intentar.", // EN: Your device's location (GPS) service is off. Turn it on and try again.
