    "Eve vard\u0131\u011f\u0131nda veya evden ayr\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Quan arribes a casa o marxes", // EN: When you arrive home or leave
    "Eve yakla\u015f\u0131rken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 a\u00e7, klimay\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015ft\u0131r ve garaj kap\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 arac\u0131n\u0131n ekran\u0131ndan kontrol et.": "Engega els llums, activa l'AC i controla la porta del garatge des de la pantalla del teu cotxe mentre t'acostes a casa.", // EN: Turn on the lights, start the AC and control the garage door from your car's screen as you approach home.
    "Evet, Uygula": "S\u00ed, Aplica", // EN: Yes, Apply
