    "Evet. NEXUS yerel \u00f6ncelikli \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r; cihaz verilerin bu cihazda kal\u0131r ve \u00fc\u00e7\u00fcnc\u00fc taraflarla payla\u015f\u0131lmaz.": "S\u00ed. NEXUS \u00e9s local-prioritari; les dades del teu dispositiu es queden en aquest dispositiu i no es comparteixen amb tercers.", // EN: Yes. NEXUS is local-first; your device data stays on this device and isn't shared with third parties.
