    "K\u00f6pr\u00fc, iOS cihaz\u0131nla ayn\u0131 Wi-Fi'da olmal\u0131. Bilgisayar a\u00e7\u0131k kald\u0131k\u00e7a e\u015fle\u015fme ge\u00e7erli kal\u0131r (tepsi/arka plan \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 destekler).": "El pont ha d'estar en la mateixa Wi-Fi que el teu dispositiu iOS. L'aparellament es mant\u00e9 v\u00e0lid mentre l'ordinador estigui actiu (s'admet operaci\u00f3 en segon pla/banda de sistema).", // EN: The bridge has to be on the same Wi-Fi as your iOS device. The pairing stays valid as long as your computer stays awake (tray/background operation supported).
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc Ba\u015flat": "Inicia el pont", // EN: Start the bridge
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcdeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, sonra tekrar dene.": "Prem el bot\u00f3 rod\u00f3 del pont, despr\u00e9s torna-ho a provar.", // EN: Press the round button on the bridge, then try again.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcn\u00fcn \u00fcst\u00fcndeki yuvarlak d\u00fc\u011fmeye bas, ard\u0131ndan 30 saniye i\u00e7inde \u201cK\u00f6pr\u00fcy\u00fc ba\u011fla\u201dya dokun.": "Prem el bot\u00f3 rod\u00f3 a la part superior del pont, despr\u00e9s toca \"Connecta el pont\" en un termini de 30 segons.", // EN: Press the round button on top of the bridge, then tap “Connect bridge” within 30 seconds.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011flan\u0131lamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol ve tekrar dene.": "No s'ha pogut connectar al pont. Assegura't que est\u00e0s a la mateixa xarxa i torna-ho a provar.", // EN: Couldn't connect to the bridge. Make sure you're on the same network and try again.
    "K\u00f6pr\u00fcye ba\u011fl\u0131 lamba bulunamad\u0131.": "No s'han trobat l\u00e0mpades connectades al pont.", // EN: No lamps connected to the bridge were found.
