    "Uyand\u0131rma cihaz\u0131 olarak ekle": "Afegeix com a dispositiu de despertador", // EN: Add as a wake-up device
    "Bu adreste bir cihaz var ama NEXUS protokol\u00fc konu\u015fmuyor.": "Hi ha un dispositiu en aquesta adre\u00e7a, per\u00f2 no parla un protocol NEXUS.", // EN: There is a device at this address, but it does not speak a NEXUS protocol.
    "Bu cihaz zaten ekli.": "Aquest dispositiu ja est\u00e0 afegit.", // EN: This device is already added.
    "E\u015fle\u015ftir ve ekle": "Emparella i afegeix", // EN: Pair and add
    "E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodu ge\u00e7ersiz. 11 haneli kodu ya da MT: ile ba\u015flayan QR i\u00e7eri\u011fini gir.": "El codi d'emparellament no \u00e9s v\u00e0lid. Introdu\u00efu el codi de 11 d\u00edgits o el contingut del QR que comenci amb MT:.", // EN: The pairing code is not valid. Enter the 11-digit code or the QR content that starts with MT:.
    "Bu kodu NEXUS masa\u00fcst\u00fc uygulamas\u0131nda gir. Cihaz Wi-Fi ile ba\u011fl\u0131ysa yerel a\u011fdan IP adresiyle de ekleyebilirsin.": "Introdu\u00efu aquest codi a l'aplicaci\u00f3 d'escriptori NEXUS. Si el dispositiu est\u00e0 connectat a Wi-Fi, tamb\u00e9 el podeu afegir des de la vostra xarxa local per la seva adre\u00e7a IP.", // EN: Enter this code in the NEXUS desktop app. If the device is on Wi-Fi, you can also add it from your local network by its IP address.
    "Cihaz ayn\u0131 a\u011fda aran\u0131yor ve e\u015fle\u015ftiriliyor. Bu bir dakikay\u0131 bulabilir; cihaz\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda olmas\u0131 gerekir.": "S'est\u00e0 cercant el dispositiu a la mateixa xarxa i emparellant-lo. Aix\u00f2 pot trigar fins a un minut; el dispositiu ha d'estar enc\u00e8s i en mode d'emparellament.", // EN: The device is being searched for on the same network and paired. This can take up to a minute; the device must be on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131 ya da e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "No s'ha trobat el dispositiu o no es pot aparellar. Assegura't que estigui a la mateixa xarxa, engegat i en mode d'aparellament.", // EN: The device was not found or could not be paired. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz bulunamad\u0131. Ayn\u0131 a\u011fda, a\u00e7\u0131k ve e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011fundan emin ol. Bilgisayar\u0131n g\u00fcvenlik duvar\u0131 yerel a\u011fdaki cihazlar\u0131n yan\u0131t\u0131n\u0131 engelliyor olabilir.": "No s'ha trobat el dispositiu. Assegura't que estigui a la mateixa xarxa, engegat i en mode d'aparellament. El tallafocs del teu ordinador podria estar bloquejant respostes dels dispositius a la xarxa local.", // EN: The device was not found. Make sure it is on the same network, powered on and in pairing mode. Your computer's firewall may be blocking replies from devices on the local network.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015ftirilemedi. E\u015fle\u015ftirme kodunu ve cihaz\u0131n e\u015fle\u015ftirme modunda oldu\u011funu kontrol et.": "No s'ha pogut aparellar el dispositiu. Comprova el codi d'aparellament i que el dispositiu estigui en mode d'aparellament.", // EN: The device could not be paired. Check the pairing code and that the device is in pairing mode.
    "Cihaz e\u015fle\u015fti ama NEXUS'un kontrol edebilece\u011fi bir i\u015flevi yok.": "El dispositiu s'ha aparellat per\u00f2 no t\u00e9 cap funci\u00f3 que NEXUS pugui controlar.", // EN: The device paired but has no function NEXUS can control.
    "Cihaz yan\u0131t vermedi. A\u00e7\u0131k ve ayn\u0131 a\u011fda oldu\u011fundan emin ol.": "El dispositiu no ha respost. Assegura't que estigui engegat i a la mateixa xarxa.", // EN: The device did not respond. Make sure it is on and on the same network.
