    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in bir sinema modu uygulamas\u0131 olu\u015ftur. Film ba\u015flat, ses seviyesi, ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan gece e\u011flence k\u0131sayollar\u0131 olsun.": "Crea una aplicaci\u00f3 de mode cinema per a televisors i dispositius multim\u00e8dia. Inclou iniciar pel\u00b7l\u00edcula, volum, llums ambientals i dreceres per a un vespre d'entreteniment sense distraccions.", // EN: Create a cinema mode app for TVs and media devices. Include start movie, volume, ambient lights and distraction-free evening entertainment shortcuts.
    "TV ve medya cihazlar\u0131 i\u00e7in tek dokunu\u015flu e\u011flence paneli.": "Panell d'entreteniment amb un sol toc per a televisors i dispositius multim\u00e8dia.", // EN: One-tap entertainment panel for TVs and media devices.
    "TV, hoparl\u00f6r ve e\u011flence cihazlar\u0131": "Televisors, altaveus i dispositius d'entreteniment", // EN: TVs, speakers and entertainment devices
    "TV, medya kutusu ve ortam \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 tek aksiyonda birle\u015ftir. Film ba\u015flat, gece modu ve dikkat da\u011f\u0131tmayan e\u011flence sahneleri kolayca kurulabilsin.": "Combina el televisor, la caixa multim\u00e8dia i les llums ambientals en una sola acci\u00f3. Facilita la configuraci\u00f3 per iniciar pel\u00b7l\u00edcula, mode nocturn i escenes d'entreteniment sense distraccions.", // EN: Combine the TV, media box and ambient lights in one action. Make it easy to set up start movie, night mode and distraction-free entertainment scenes.
    "Tabii ki! Senin i\u00e7in harika bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 senaryo kurgulayabilirim. Bana biraz detay verir misin? \u00d6rne\u011fin: \"Sabah uyand\u0131\u011f\u0131mda kahve makinesi \u00e7al\u0131\u015fs\u0131n\" veya \"Film izlerken \u0131\u015f\u0131klar tamamen k\u0131s\u0131ls\u0131n\" gibi bir istekte bulunabilirsin.": "\u00c9s clar! Puc crear un gran escenari intel\u00b7ligent per a tu. Em podries donar alguns detalls? Per exemple: \"Iniciar la cafetera quan em desperti\" o \"Apagar completament les llums quan vegi una pel\u00b7l\u00edcula\".", // EN: Of course! I can put together a great smart scenario for you. Could you give me a few details? For example: "Start the coffee machine when I wake up" or "Dim the lights fully when I watch a movie".
