    "T\u00fcm evi oda bazl\u0131 kontrol eden bir ak\u0131ll\u0131 \u0131\u015f\u0131k paneli olu\u015ftur. Her oda i\u00e7in ac/kapat, parlakl\u0131k ve renk s\u0131cakl\u0131\u011f\u0131 kontrolleri olsun. Hemen kullan\u0131labilecek h\u0131zl\u0131 yuzdeler ve tumunu ac/tumunu kapat aksiyonlar\u0131 ekle.": "Crea un panell d'il\u00b7luminaci\u00f3 intel\u00b7ligent que controli tota la casa habitaci\u00f3 per habitaci\u00f3. Inclou controls d'encesa/apagada, brillantor i temperatura de color per a cada habitaci\u00f3. Afegeix percentatges r\u00e0pids i ja preparats i totes les accions d'encesa/totes apagades.", // EN: Create a smart lighting panel that controls the whole home room by room. Include on/off, brightness and color temperature controls for each room. Add ready-to-use quick percentages and all on/all off actions.
