    "\u00c7al\u0131\u015f\u0131rken sessizlik, do\u011fru \u0131\u015f\u0131k ve bildirim aras\u0131.": "Il\u00b7luminaci\u00f3 adequada i silenciosa i sense interrupcions mentre treballes.", // EN: Quiet, proper lighting and no interruptions while you work.
