    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce gerekli t\u00fcm ev kontrollerini tek merkezde topla. I\u015f\u0131k azaltma, rahats\u0131z etme, kilit kontrol\u00fc ve gece iklim ayarlar\u0131 tek ekranda y\u00f6netilsin.": "Recull totes les comprovacions dom\u00e8stiques necess\u00e0ries abans d'anar a dormir en un sol centre. Ajusta la intensitat de les llums, no molestar, comprovaci\u00f3 de bloqueig i configuracions de clima nocturn en una sola pantalla.", // EN: Gather all the home checks you need before bed in one center. Dim lights, do not disturb, lock check and night climate settings on one screen.
    "Yatmadan \u00f6nce \u0131\u015f\u0131k, sessiz mod, kilit ve iklim ayarlar\u0131n\u0131 y\u00f6neten bir uykuya haz\u0131rl\u0131k merkezi olu\u015ftur. Son kontrol \u00f6zeti ve tek dokunu\u015f gece modu ekle.": "Crea un centre de preparaci\u00f3 per anar a dormir que gestioni les llums, el mode silenci\u00f3s, les tancadures i el clima abans de dormir. Afegeix un resum de comprovaci\u00f3 final i un mode nocturn amb un sol toc.", // EN: Create a bedtime preparation center that manages lights, quiet mode, locks and climate before bed. Add a final check summary and one-tap night mode.
