    "Bu ekran\u0131 iPhone'daki NEXUS uygulamas\u0131nda a\u00e7; senaryolar\u0131n a\u015fa\u011f\u0131da listelenir ve her biri i\u00e7in Siri kestirmesi kurabilirsin.": "Obre aquesta pantalla a l'aplicaci\u00f3 NEXUS al teu iPhone; les teves escenes estan llistades a continuaci\u00f3 i pots configurar una drecera de Siri per a cadascuna.", // EN: Open this screen in the NEXUS app on your iPhone; your scenes are listed below and you can set up a Siri shortcut for each one.
    "1. Senaryo ba\u011flant\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 kopyala": "1. Copia l'enlla\u00e7 de l'escena", // EN: 1. Copy the scene link
