    "2. Kestirmeler'de yeni kestirme olu\u015ftur": "2. Crea una nova drecera a Dreceres", // EN: 2. Create a new shortcut in Shortcuts
    "\"Eylem Ekle\" \u203a \"URL'leri A\u00e7\" eylemini se\u00e7 ve kopyalad\u0131\u011f\u0131n ba\u011flant\u0131y\u0131 yap\u0131\u015ft\u0131r.": "Tria \"Afegeix acci\u00f3\" \u203a \"Obre URLs\" i enganxa l'enlla\u00e7 que has copiat.", // EN: Choose "Add Action" › "Open URLs" and paste the link you copied.
