    "Kap\u0131/pencere sens\u00f6r\u00fc a\u00e7\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Quan un sensor de porta/finestra s'obre", // EN: When a door/window sensor opens
    "Duman, su bask\u0131n\u0131 ya da gaz sens\u00f6r\u00fc uyard\u0131\u011f\u0131nda": "Quan un sensor de fum, inundaci\u00f3 o gas activa una alarma", // EN: When a smoke, flood or gas sensor raises an alarm
    "Cihaz ve sens\u00f6r tetikleyicileri, uygun bir cihaz ekleyince burada g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcr.": "Els desencadenants de dispositius i sensors apareixen aqu\u00ed un cop afegeixis un dispositiu adequat.", // EN: Device and sensor triggers appear here once you add a suitable device.
    "Ev ve \u00c7evre": "Llar i entorn", // EN: Home & Surroundings
    "S\u0131cakl\u0131k, r\u00fczg\u00e2r ya da ya\u011f\u0131\u015f bir e\u015fi\u011fi ge\u00e7ti\u011finde": "Quan la temperatura, el vent o la pluja supera un llindar", // EN: When temperature, wind or rain passes a threshold
    "T\u00fcm \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 a\u00e7": "Enc\u00e9n tots els llums", // EN: Turn on all lights
    "Ak\u015fam yeme\u011fi": "Sopar", // EN: Dinner
    "Perdeleri a\u00e7": "Obre les cortines", // EN: Open the curtains
    "Kap\u0131lar\u0131 kilitle": "Tanca les portes", // EN: Lock the doors
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta a\u00e7ar.": "Ence\u0300n tots els llums a la m\u00e0xima intensitat.", // EN: Turns on every light at full brightness.
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Apaga tots els llums.", // EN: Turns off every light.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 tam parlakl\u0131kta, g\u00fcn \u0131\u015f\u0131\u011f\u0131 tonunda a\u00e7ar.": "Ence\u0300n els llums a la m\u00e0xima intensitat amb un to de llum di\u00fcrna.", // EN: Turns lights on at full brightness in a daylight tone.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %85 n\u00f6tr tona getirir, TV'yi kapat\u0131r.": "Estableix els llums al 85% en un to neutre i apaga la TV.", // EN: Sets lights to 85% in a neutral tone and turns off the TV.
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 %40 s\u0131cak tona getirir.": "Estableix els llums al 40% en un to c\u00e0lid.", // EN: Sets lights to 40% in a warm tone.
    "Her ak\u015fam 19:30": "Cada vespre a les 19:30", // EN: Every evening 19:30
    "Klimay\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131p 20\u00b0'ye, termostat\u0131 20\u00b0'ye ayarlar.": "Enc\u00e9n l'aire condicionat a 20\u00b0 i ajusta el term\u00f2stat a 20\u00b0.", // EN: Turns the AC on at 20° and sets the thermostat to 20°.
    "Termostat\u0131 24\u00b0 konfor ayar\u0131na getirir.": "Ajusta el term\u00f2stat a una temperatura de confort de 24\u00b0.", // EN: Sets the thermostat to a 24° comfort setting.
    "Hafta i\u00e7i 06:30": "Dies feiners a les 06:30", // EN: Weekdays 06:30
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 a\u00e7ar.": "Obre totes les cortines i persianes.", // EN: Opens every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn do\u011fumunda": "Cada dia a la sortida del sol", // EN: Every day at sunrise
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn perde ve panjurlar\u0131 kapat\u0131r.": "Tanca totes les cortines i persianes.", // EN: Closes every curtain and blind.
    "Her g\u00fcn g\u00fcn bat\u0131m\u0131nda": "Cada dia a la posta de sol", // EN: Every day at sunset
    "B\u00fct\u00fcn ak\u0131ll\u0131 kilitleri kilitler (kilit hi\u00e7bir zaman a\u00e7\u0131lmaz).": "Tanca totes les tancadures intel\u00b7ligents (les tancadures mai s'obren).", // EN: Locks every smart lock (locks are never unlocked).
    "I\u015f\u0131klar\u0131 ve TV'yi kapat\u0131r; prizlere ve klimaya dokunmaz.": "Apaga llums i la TV; deixa els endolls i l'aire condicionat tal com estan.", // EN: Turns off lights and the TV; leaves plugs and the AC alone.
    "Bir cihaz\u0131 a\u00e7 ya da kapat": "Engega o apaga un dispositiu", // EN: Turn a device on or off
    "Se\u00e7ti\u011fin tek cihaza komut g\u00f6nderir.": "Envia un comandament al dispositiu que tri\u00efs.", // EN: Sends a command to the one device you pick.
