    "Davet e-postas\u0131ndaki kodu gir. Kod tek kullan\u0131ml\u0131kt\u0131r ve yaln\u0131zca davet edilen e-posta adresiyle \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131r.": "Introdueix el codi del correu electr\u00f2nic d'invitaci\u00f3. El codi \u00e9s d'un sol \u00fas i nom\u00e9s funciona amb l'adre\u00e7a de correu electr\u00f2nic convidada.", // EN: Enter the code from the invitation email. The code is single-use and only works with the invited email address.
