    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; {0} yerle\u015fik bir HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc Apple Ev'e ger\u00e7ek aksesuar yay\u0131nlar (a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki panelden ba\u015flat). Web/telefon s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde k\u00f6pr\u00fc yoktur.": "", // EN: NEXUS reaches your devices directly from its own app; on desktop, {0} built-in HomeKit bridge publishes real accessories to Apple Home (start it from the panel below). The web/phone version has no bridge.
    "NEXUS, cihazlar\u0131na do\u011frudan kendi uygulamas\u0131ndan eri\u015fir; telefon/web s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fcnde HomeKit k\u00f6pr\u00fcs\u00fc i\u00e7ermez. Apple Ev (HomeKit) ile kullanmak istersen en pratik yol {0}: cihazlar\u0131n\u0131 Home Assistant'a ekler, HA'n\u0131n HomeKit entegrasyonunu a\u00e7ars\u0131n.": "", // EN: NEXUS reaches your devices directly from its own app; the phone/web version does not include a HomeKit bridge. To use them with Apple Home (HomeKit), the practical path is {0}: add your devices to Home Assistant, then enable HA's HomeKit integration.
