    "^(.+) eklendi\\. Ana sayfadaki d\u00fc\u011fme uyand\u0131rma paketi g\u00f6nderir\\.$": "", // EN: $1 added. The button on the home page sends a wake-up packet.
    "^(\\S+) adresindeki Tuya cihaz\u0131n\u0131n kimli\u011fi ve s\u00fcr\u00fcm\u00fc otomatik okundu\\. Eklemek i\u00e7in yaln\u0131zca yerel anahtar\u0131 \\(Tuya IoT hesab\u0131ndan\\) gir\\. Anahtar yaln\u0131zca bu cihazda saklan\u0131r\\.$": "", // EN: The Tuya device at $1 was identified automatically (ID and version). To add it, enter only the local key (from your Tuya IoT account). The key is stored only on this device.
    "^(\\S+) \u00b7 yaln\u0131zca yerel anahtar gerekir$": "", // EN: $1 · only the local key is needed
